  "$comment": "The eight JRNY-04 guided-intake steps. Every one is reached by SEEDING A COMPLETE IntakeFormState draft into localStorage before first paint, never by clicking through the steps before it - GuidedIntakeForm initialises its whole state, currentStep included, from localStorage['inheritance-intake-draft']. EVERY FIXTURE IS A COMPLETE STATE ON PURPOSE: seeding a partial draft such as {\"currentStep\":2,\"conflictCheck\":{\"outcome\":\"skipped\"}} crashes the application into its error boundary with \"Something went wrong! Show Error\" and \"TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'full_name')\", which is why every intake rubric also carries a no-crash assertion. No step here submits the form, so no cases or clients row is created and no reset is needed.",
